{"id": "ru-fd6958211b4a.ru", "jokeId": "ru-fd6958211b4a", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Helper merged into the foreman's line to the crowd; nailing the lid becomes his order to the crew. Single scene: the foreman walks up to the 'corpse' before it grabs him.", "title": "Контрольное захоронение", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Похороны на кладбище. Бригадир гробовщиков видит: у покойника из нагрудного кармана торчит пятьдесят рублей.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Граждане, отойдите от гроба, нам надо крышку проверить.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Налоговая полиция! Контрольное захоронение!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "У тебя своя работа, а у меня своя. Мужики, гвозди!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-fd6958211b4a.en", "jokeId": "ru-fd6958211b4a", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Roubles to dollars; adaptNote line kept. Nailing the lid becomes the foreman's order to his crew so a character delivers the punchline.", "title": "The Sting", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A funeral at the cemetery. The head gravedigger spots a fifty-dollar bill sticking out of the dead man's pocket.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Folks, step back from the coffin, please. We need to check the lid.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Tax police! Sting burial!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "You've got your job, and I've got mine. Boys, the nails!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-fd6958211b4a.de", "jokeId": "ru-fd6958211b4a", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Roubles to euros; adaptNote line kept. Nailing the lid becomes the foreman's order to his crew.", "title": "Testbeerdigung", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Beerdigung auf dem Friedhof. Der Chef der Totengräber sieht einen Fünfzigeuroschein aus der Brusttasche des Toten ragen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Leute, treten Sie bitte vom Sarg zurück, wir müssen den Deckel prüfen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Steuerfahndung! Testbeerdigung!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Du machst deinen Job, ich mach meinen. Jungs, die Nägel!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-2821b3866f47.ru", "jokeId": "ru-2821b3866f47", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Two colleagues at the office; the neighbour puppet plays the colleague who answers.", "title": "Среда", "location": "ofis", "cast": ["paren", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "lines": [{"character": "paren", "text": "Слушай, третий день подряд не хочется работать. Что бы это значило?", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Наверное, сегодня среда.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "laugh"}]}
{"id": "ru-2821b3866f47.en", "jokeId": "ru-2821b3866f47", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Two colleagues at the office; the neighbour puppet plays the colleague who answers.", "title": "Wednesday", "location": "ofis", "cast": ["paren", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "lines": [{"character": "paren", "text": "Listen, it's the third day I don't feel like working. What could that mean?", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Must be Wednesday.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "laugh"}]}
{"id": "ru-2821b3866f47.de", "jokeId": "ru-2821b3866f47", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Two colleagues at the office; the neighbour puppet plays the colleague who answers.", "title": "Mittwoch", "location": "ofis", "cast": ["paren", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "lines": [{"character": "paren", "text": "Sag mal, seit drei Tagen hab ich keine Lust zu arbeiten. Was hat das zu bedeuten?", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Dann ist heute wohl Mittwoch.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "laugh"}]}
{"id": "ru-439efbf4839a.ru", "jokeId": "ru-439efbf4839a", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Professor's thought spoken aloud; narrator covers the time skip; the professor walks over to the student's desk.", "title": "Монетка", "location": "klass", "cast": ["paren", "doktor"], "roles": {"paren": "student", "doktor": "professor"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Экзамен. На все вопросы теста надо ответить да или нет. Один студент подбрасывает монетку и записывает ответы.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Ну, этот первым закончит.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Прошёл час. Все давно сдали и ушли, а он всё сидит и бросает монетку.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Ну что, ответил на вопросы?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Да.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "А чего тогда делаешь?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Проверяю.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "klass", "cast": ["paren", "doktor"], "roles": {"paren": "student", "doktor": "professor"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "student-desk"}, {"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "teacher-desk"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-439efbf4839a.en", "jokeId": "ru-439efbf4839a", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Professor's thought spoken aloud; narrator covers the time skip; the professor walks over to the student's desk.", "title": "Heads or Tails", "location": "klass", "cast": ["paren", "doktor"], "roles": {"paren": "student", "doktor": "professor"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "An exam. Every question on the test is yes or no. One student flips a coin and writes down the answers.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Well, this one will finish first.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "An hour later everyone has handed in and left, but he's still sitting there flipping that coin.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "So, have you answered the questions?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Yes.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Then what are you doing?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Checking.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "klass", "cast": ["paren", "doktor"], "roles": {"paren": "student", "doktor": "professor"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "student-desk"}, {"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "teacher-desk"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-439efbf4839a.de", "jokeId": "ru-439efbf4839a", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Professor's thought spoken aloud; narrator covers the time skip; the professor walks over to the student's desk.", "title": "Kopf oder Zahl", "location": "klass", "cast": ["paren", "doktor"], "roles": {"paren": "student", "doktor": "professor"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Prüfung. Jede Frage im Test wird mit Ja oder Nein beantwortet. Ein Student wirft eine Münze und schreibt die Ergebnisse auf.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Na, der ist als Erster fertig.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Eine Stunde später sind alle längst weg, aber er sitzt immer noch da und wirft seine Münze.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Na, haben Sie die Fragen beantwortet?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Ja.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Und was machen Sie dann noch?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Ich prüfe nach.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "klass", "cast": ["paren", "doktor"], "roles": {"paren": "student", "doktor": "professor"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "student-desk"}, {"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "teacher-desk"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-106e895bb3a5.ru", "jokeId": "ru-106e895bb3a5", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Monologue split into short lines; the pilot stays silent on screen so the reveal lands on the last line; the attendant walks out after it. Signature fragment dropped.", "title": "Турбулентность", "location": "samolet", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "devushka-blondinka"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "pilot", "devushka-blondinka": "flight-attendant"}, "lines": [{"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Ну что вы раскричались, что разнервничались!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Подумаешь, тряхнуло три раза. Обычная воздушная яма.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "С кем не бывает. Всё, всё, успокаиваемся.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Всё хорошо? Ну и ладненько.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Пойду теперь пассажиров успокою.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "exit": ["devushka-blondinka"], "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-106e895bb3a5.en", "jokeId": "ru-106e895bb3a5", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Monologue split into short lines; the pilot stays silent on screen so the reveal lands on the last line; the attendant walks out after it. Signature fragment dropped.", "title": "Turbulence", "location": "samolet", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "devushka-blondinka"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "pilot", "devushka-blondinka": "flight-attendant"}, "lines": [{"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Come on, what's all the shouting, what's all the panic!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "So we got shaken three times. It's just an air pocket.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Happens to everyone. There, there, deep breaths.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "All better now? There we go.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Right, now I'll go and calm down the passengers.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "exit": ["devushka-blondinka"], "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-106e895bb3a5.de", "jokeId": "ru-106e895bb3a5", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Monologue split into short lines; the pilot stays silent on screen so the reveal lands on the last line; the attendant walks out after it. Signature fragment dropped.", "title": "Turbulenzen", "location": "samolet", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "devushka-blondinka"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "pilot", "devushka-blondinka": "flight-attendant"}, "lines": [{"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Na, was schreien Sie denn so, warum so nervös!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Dann hat es eben dreimal gewackelt. Ein ganz normales Luftloch.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Kann jedem passieren. So, so, ganz ruhig.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Alles wieder gut? Na also.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "So, jetzt beruhige ich mal die Passagiere.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "exit": ["devushka-blondinka"], "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-ed98cbe6a5c3.ru", "jokeId": "ru-ed98cbe6a5c3", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Three-line dialogue in one place, no staging needed.", "title": "Перепела", "location": "bar", "cast": ["muzhik", "barmen"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "barmen": "waiter"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Официант, можно этих перепелов ещё немного пожарить?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "А что, плохо прожарены?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Не знаю, но они у меня салат жрут.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-ed98cbe6a5c3.en", "jokeId": "ru-ed98cbe6a5c3", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Three-line dialogue in one place, no staging needed.", "title": "The Quails", "location": "bar", "cast": ["muzhik", "barmen"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "barmen": "waiter"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Waiter, could you cook these quails a little longer?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Why, are they underdone?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "No idea, but they're eating my salad.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-ed98cbe6a5c3.de", "jokeId": "ru-ed98cbe6a5c3", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Three-line dialogue in one place, no staging needed.", "title": "Die Wachteln", "location": "bar", "cast": ["muzhik", "barmen"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "barmen": "waiter"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Herr Ober, können Sie die Wachteln noch ein bisschen braten?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Wieso, sind sie nicht durch?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Keine Ahnung, aber sie fressen mir den Salat weg.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f.ru", "jokeId": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Rewritten by hand under the 'tell the whole joke' rule: all four escalation steps kept, money handed over each time.", "title": "Для ровного счёта", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "friend", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Чёрт, кошелёк забыл, а мне десятки не хватает. Одолжишь?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ну, держи.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На следующий день.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я тебе десятку должен?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Да.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Опять кошелёк забыл. Одолжи ещё сорок, буду ровно полтинник должен.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ну, хорошо.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На следующий день.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я тебе пятьдесят должен?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Да.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Опять я без кошелька. Займи ещё сто пятьдесят, двести сразу и отдам.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ну ладно.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На следующий день.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я тебе двести должен?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ну конечно.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Давай для ровного счёта займу ещё триста, и сразу полтыщи отдам.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ну что ж делать, держи.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На следующий день.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я тебе пятьсот должен?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "enter": [], "exit": []}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Нет!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "enter": [], "exit": []}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "friend", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l15"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l16"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l17"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l18"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l19"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l20"}], "transition": "cut"}]}
{"id": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f.en", "jokeId": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Four days compressed into three wipe-separated scenes; the narrator summarises the two middle loans; the friend hands over money each time. Currency localised.", "title": "Round Number", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Damn, I forgot my wallet, and I'm ten bucks short. Can you lend me some?", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Sure, here.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Do I owe you ten?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Yes.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Forgot my wallet again. Lend me forty more, and I'll owe you an even fifty.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Then he borrowed a hundred and fifty more, and then three hundred, to make it a round number.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Do I owe you five hundred?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "No!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}]}, {"location": "ulitsa", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}, {"location": "ulitsa", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f.de", "jokeId": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Four days compressed into three wipe-separated scenes; the narrator summarises the two middle loans; the friend hands over money each time. Currency localised.", "title": "Runde Summe", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Mist, Geldbeutel vergessen, und mir fehlen zehn Euro. Leihst du mir was?", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Na, hier.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Schulde ich dir zehn Euro?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ja.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Schon wieder den Geldbeutel vergessen. Leih mir noch vierzig, dann schulde ich dir glatte fünfzig.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Danach lieh er sich noch hundertfünfzig, und dann dreihundert, damit es rund wird.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Schulde ich dir fünfhundert?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Nein!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}]}, {"location": "ulitsa", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}, {"location": "ulitsa", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-9d24f41254be.ru", "jokeId": "ru-9d24f41254be", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Phone call turned into the husband bursting into the doctor's office, so both speakers share one place; a cross-cut phone call is blocked by the top-level-cast rule.", "title": "Вторая жена", "location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["doktor", "muzhik"], "roles": {"doktor": "doctor", "muzhik": "husband"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Доктор, умоляю, поедемте скорее! У жены сильный приступ аппендицита!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["muzhik"]}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Не волнуйтесь. Два года назад я сам оперировал вашу жену и удалил ей аппендикс.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Второй аппендикс у человека появиться не может!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Верно, доктор. Но у человека может появиться вторая жена.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-9d24f41254be.en", "jokeId": "ru-9d24f41254be", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Phone call turned into the husband bursting into the doctor's office, so both speakers share one place; a cross-cut phone call is blocked by the top-level-cast rule.", "title": "Second Wife", "location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["doktor", "muzhik"], "roles": {"doktor": "doctor", "muzhik": "husband"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Doctor, please, you have to come right away! My wife is having a terrible appendicitis attack!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["muzhik"]}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Calm down. Two years ago I operated on your wife myself and took out her appendix.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "A person can't have a second appendix!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Right, doctor. But a person can have a second wife.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
